{"id":1826857,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-16T21:08:18.249Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1826857,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["RU"],"original_language":"ru","original_title":"Сцены из «Капитала»","overview":"In Sergei Eisenstein’s vast legacy there is a long list of unrealised projects. Among them, perhaps the most famous of the unmade is an adaptation of Marx’s Das Kapital. Eisenstein worked on it for two years, in 1927–1928; the archives hold numerous notes, drawings, and collages for the film that was to come. It was not to be a literal adaptation so much as a demonstration of how Marx’s dialectical method itself works. For that, Eisenstein wanted to use the narrative lessons of James Joyce. This is an attempt to imagine how Eisenstein would have moved from that idea to its film form had he had the tools of artificial intelligence in his hands.","popularity":0.2329,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-10-22","revenue":0,"runtime":13,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Russian","iso_639_1":"ru","name":"Pусский"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Scenes from Capital","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3732570,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Fedor Maximishin","original_name":"Fedor Maximshin","popularity":0.1956,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6afa052294624f385f645ee2","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":6669642,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Darya Suslova","original_name":"Darya Suslova","popularity":0.097,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6afa05343d496b98b86e2d96","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6669643,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Mikhail Ratgauz","original_name":"Mikhail Ratgauz